-- =====================================================================
-- Photographs for the example catalogue (../00_example_catalogue.sql).
--
-- CC0 / public-domain stock (sources in photos.tsv). The FILES must be in
-- the media bucket before these rows exist: run scripts/example-photos.sh,
-- which uploads them and then runs this file. The first photo of each
-- supplier becomes its cover (media_00_before_insert).
--
-- Idempotent: unique (provider_id, external_id). Kept out of seed/examples/
-- itself so db-reset's WITH_EXAMPLES never adds rows for files that are not
-- in the local MinIO.
-- Removed with the catalogue by scripts/remove-example-catalogue.sql.
-- =====================================================================
on conflict (provider_id, external_id) do nothing;
